{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122456","id":4288650989,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7_n57t","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122456","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122456.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122456.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122456","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122456/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122456/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122456/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/244152cba10cd4f90e9531e7a85b6dd3f59e29c5","number":122456,"state":"open","locked":false,"title":"Use icon for `TextEdit` squiggle underlines","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch. We will take care of backporting relevant fixes to older versions.\r\n\r\nBefore submitting, please read our checklist for contributors:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/introduction.html#checklist-for-new-contributors\r\n\r\nUse of AI must be disclosed and should include a description of how it was used.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\n- Closes https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/15352\r\n- Related https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285\r\n\r\nUses a new icon to draw underlines.\r\nI chose to use an icon since it gives higher quality visuals than a line mesh.\r\n\r\nProfiling on a dev build, it is faster than using polyline or even mesh, and there is no need to calculate the points or allocate arrays. It draws 1 texture per visible line per underline.\r\nAverage TextEdit draw duration:\r\nPolyline (before) 6.8ms\r\nMesh 4.6ms\r\nIcon (PR) 3.3ms\r\n\r\nPolyline (before):\r\n<img width=\"1011\" height=\"288\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-15 171128\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/88fa7d6a-76d0-4ec5-8ec2-947f4dbfb9a5\" />\r\n\r\nMesh:\r\n<img width=\"1002\" height=\"269\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-15 171143\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0b00573d-ee6b-4291-913e-1879bfc500d6\" />\r\n\r\nIcon (PR):\r\n<img width=\"1007\" height=\"282\" alt=\"Screenshot 2026-08-15 171135\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8571644a-845b-40c8-a780-a163b10c6fdb\" />\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nIcon made in GodSVG. \r\nIts inspired by the VSCode one, its less pointy than before.\r\n\r\nI addressed https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122285#discussion_r3755875501 by not merging the selections, which meant I had to add code to handle inline objects.\r\n\r\nTo profile, I temporarily exposed underlines to avoid editor overhead (and because tracy isn't sampling in editor for me for some reason). But even with polyline it isn't that slow for me so it would be good to confirm that this fixes the performance issue.\r\n\r\nThe texture is tiled to the length of the line. It is also scaled with the font size, and the best way I found to allow this is to put it on a new canvas item that has a scaled transform.\r\nSince the underlines are a separate canvas item I had to move code completion and code hint to a new canvas item so they draw over underlines. This won't be needed with https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120900, or if I figure out how to move them to new windows.\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","description":"","color":"447777","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":8237783,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AfbLX","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/16","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/16/labels","number":16,"state":"open","title":"4.x","description":"Issues and pull requests slated for an undetermined Godot 4 release.","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gi